[gd_resource type="Theme" load_steps=5 format=3 uid="uid://ctingenthemem16"]

; M16 — Tingen shared UI theme. Occult-noir dossier aesthetic to sit against the painted city:
; dark ink/parchment panels, a warm gilt accent on borders and hovers, cream serif-neutral text.
; Set as the project-wide gui theme (project.godot [gui] theme/custom) so the title, HUD and every
; code-built panel inherit it. It only supplies DEFAULTS: the M10 Settings seams (per-Control
; text_scale font-size overrides and the colorblind meter/telegraph palette, both applied via
; add_theme_*_override / drawn directly) still win over these values — accessibility is unaffected.

